    "detailed_description": "Take to the role of The InVincible Iron Ivy (&quot;Iron Ivy&quot;) in this Soulslike 3rd person role-playing game (\u201cRPG\u201d) who has superpowers that harness properties encompassing concepts of science called &quot;Sci-fi Powers.&quot; <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578220/extras/e6cb00b9c10d32138a2f594510959d5d.poster.avif?t=1700126445\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578220/extras/e6cb00b9c10d32138a2f594510959d5d.webm?t=1700126445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578220/extras/e6cb00b9c10d32138a2f594510959d5d.mp4?t=1700126445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Iron Ivy\u2019s powers are labeled as Geokinesis, which provides her with the ability to manipulate and control both the elements of earth and nature. This dynamic includes synthesizing lightning bolts, controlling and manipulating, moisture, and barometric/atmospheric pressure to form, and manipulating gases and liquids to cause chemical reactions. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578220/extras/9817eff618ca48205d1c216cc85c2df7.poster.avif?t=1700126445\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578220/extras/9817eff618ca48205d1c216cc85c2df7.webm?t=1700126445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578220/extras/9817eff618ca48205d1c216cc85c2df7.mp4?t=1700126445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Additionally, she uses this ability to manipulate ivy leaves to make her ivy board that provides her with flight. Finally, Iron Ivy has the ability to transmute plants into humanoid and animaloid (&quot;animal-like&quot;) creatures like her A.I. companions Sunny, Snapper, and Lily. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578220/extras/90a4a0e6fc55db0c418b5f7f62fd2213.poster.avif?t=1700126445\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578220/extras/90a4a0e6fc55db0c418b5f7f62fd2213.webm?t=1700126445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578220/extras/90a4a0e6fc55db0c418b5f7f62fd2213.mp4?t=1700126445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You will unlock Iron Ivy's Sci-FI Powers by accumulating experience points (\u201cXP\u201d), deactivating enemy troopers, acquiring items and special attributes, rare tools; and the exploration and completing quests.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578220/extras/527f5f988353b85e9256c1698a8d19bb.poster.avif?t=1700126445\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578220/extras/527f5f988353b85e9256c1698a8d19bb.webm?t=1700126445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578220/extras/527f5f988353b85e9256c1698a8d19bb.mp4?t=1700126445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578220/extras/27dba991c05789af9331babf9c985d6b.poster.avif?t=1700126445\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578220/extras/27dba991c05789af9331babf9c985d6b.webm?t=1700126445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578220/extras/27dba991c05789af9331babf9c985d6b.mp4?t=1700126445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Take to the role of The InVincible Iron Ivy (&quot;Iron Ivy&quot;) in this Soulslike 3rd person role-playing game (\u201cRPG\u201d) who has superpowers that harness properties encompassing concepts of science called &quot;Sci-fi Powers.&quot; <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578220/extras/e6cb00b9c10d32138a2f594510959d5d.poster.avif?t=1700126445\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578220/extras/e6cb00b9c10d32138a2f594510959d5d.webm?t=1700126445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578220/extras/e6cb00b9c10d32138a2f594510959d5d.mp4?t=1700126445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Iron Ivy\u2019s powers are labeled as Geokinesis, which provides her with the ability to manipulate and control both the elements of earth and nature. This dynamic includes synthesizing lightning bolts, controlling and manipulating, moisture, and barometric/atmospheric pressure to form, and manipulating gases and liquids to cause chemical reactions. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578220/extras/9817eff618ca48205d1c216cc85c2df7.poster.avif?t=1700126445\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578220/extras/9817eff618ca48205d1c216cc85c2df7.webm?t=1700126445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578220/extras/9817eff618ca48205d1c216cc85c2df7.mp4?t=1700126445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Additionally, she uses this ability to manipulate ivy leaves to make her ivy board that provides her with flight. Finally, Iron Ivy has the ability to transmute plants into humanoid and animaloid (&quot;animal-like&quot;) creatures like her A.I. companions Sunny, Snapper, and Lily. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578220/extras/90a4a0e6fc55db0c418b5f7f62fd2213.poster.avif?t=1700126445\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578220/extras/90a4a0e6fc55db0c418b5f7f62fd2213.webm?t=1700126445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578220/extras/90a4a0e6fc55db0c418b5f7f62fd2213.mp4?t=1700126445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You will unlock Iron Ivy's Sci-FI Powers by accumulating experience points (\u201cXP\u201d), deactivating enemy troopers, acquiring items and special attributes, rare tools; and the exploration and completing quests.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578220/extras/527f5f988353b85e9256c1698a8d19bb.poster.avif?t=1700126445\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578220/extras/527f5f988353b85e9256c1698a8d19bb.webm?t=1700126445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578220/extras/527f5f988353b85e9256c1698a8d19bb.mp4?t=1700126445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578220/extras/27dba991c05789af9331babf9c985d6b.poster.avif?t=1700126445\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578220/extras/27dba991c05789af9331babf9c985d6b.webm?t=1700126445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578220/extras/27dba991c05789af9331babf9c985d6b.mp4?t=1700126445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
